# Typecheck before tests: vitest runs the code, it does not type it, so a type
# error passes here and fails in CI minutes later. That happened on
# 0.12.0-rc.1 — a `spawnSync` option that does not exist in SpawnSyncOptions
# sailed through a green 788-test run because the last local typecheck predated
# the file. Costs a few seconds.
npm run typecheck

npm test

